# Pre-Code Gate

Before Write/Edit on non-trivial work, run the pre-code-gate skill (or sparc-lite for large features).

**Level 0 SKIP:** typo, comment-only, user says "just do it", approved plan, single-line fix.

**Level 1:** medium tasks — 10 questions + compact PASS output.

**Level 2:** large features — sparc-lite mini-spec first, then Level 1.

Document gate result in conversation before coding. BLOCK means stop and clarify with user.
